# Sitemap: @astrojs/sitemap generates /sitemap-index.xml + /sitemap-0.xml.
# Serve the conventional /sitemap.xml and bare /sitemap from the index (200, not a
# redirect hop) so anything looking for either finds it. Lisbon Property and South
# Bank do the same — Search Console holds stale bare-/sitemap submissions on both.
/sitemap.xml        /sitemap-index.xml  200
/sitemap            /sitemap-index.xml  200
